{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":432,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":38866,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":41390,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":207275,"Name":"Heidi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207275.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1176145186,"LastPoster":{"Id":287558,"Name":"Cymande","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":25,"Preview":{"Id":41390,"PostDate":1176145186,"PostContent":"I'm working with a travel agent who is recommending Aruba to me as a possible destination. Specif...","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married April 4, 2008 at the Riu Ocho Rios!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hln321@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1174600020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207275.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heidi","Id":207275,"Name":"Heidi","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e768b86650d45bf7473c3e087f24d26","RawContent":"I&#039;m working with a travel agent who is recommending Aruba to me as a possible destination. Specifically, she recommends the Divi (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.diviaruba.com\/divihome.html\"&gt;Divi Aruba All Inclusive Home Page&lt;\/a&gt;) &amp;amp; the Tamarijn (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.tamarijnaruba.com\/tamhome.html\"&gt;Tamarijn Aruba All Inclusive Home Page&lt;\/a&gt;). Has anyone been to either resort? Also, does anyone have additional information about Aruba? We are trying to decide between Jamaica &amp;amp; Aruba now, so any information would be helpful!","Attachments":[],"Id":41390,"PostDate":1176145186,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm working with a travel agent who is recommending Aruba to me as a possible destination. Specifically, she recommends the Divi (<a href='http:\/\/www.diviaruba.com\/divihome.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Divi Aruba All Inclusive Home Page<\/a>) & the Tamarijn (<a href='http:\/\/www.tamarijnaruba.com\/tamhome.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Tamarijn Aruba All Inclusive Home Page<\/a>). Has anyone been to either resort? Also, does anyone have additional information about Aruba? We are trying to decide between Jamaica & Aruba now, so any information would be helpful!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married April 4, 2008 at the Riu Ocho Rios!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hln321@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1174600020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207275.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heidi","Id":207275,"Name":"Heidi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1873116b74c30b61b0acab117fb3f990","RawContent":"Aruba, hu? It&#039;s georgous!!! My parents are in the process of buying a timeshare there. Marriott Surf Club. Basically I just now the basics of the island. It only get 16 inches of rain a year. It&#039;s on the outter edge of the huricane path so isn&#039;t affected by storms. Also, a friend that went said that the water is so calm and beautiful that you can bring a floatie and pant yourself in the ocean and not have to worry about the waves or tide taking you out. You just sit and float. It sounds like paradise! \n \n And the sand. OH. MY. GOD. It&#039;s sugar. We&#039;re planning on the DR but since my parents have been researching and buying in Aruba we&#039;re thinking of switching (as to be expected as we can&#039;t make a decision to save our lives!) Do you want to get married on the beach?","Attachments":[],"Id":44220,"PostDate":1176921486,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Aruba, hu? It's georgous!!! My parents are in the process of buying a timeshare there. Marriott Surf Club. Basically I just now the basics of the island. It only get 16 inches of rain a year. It's on the outter edge of the huricane path so isn't affected by storms. Also, a friend that went said that the water is so calm and beautiful that you can bring a floatie and pant yourself in the ocean and not have to worry about the waves or tide taking you out. You just sit and float. It sounds like paradise! <br \/> <br \/> And the sand. OH. MY. GOD. It's sugar. We're planning on the DR but since my parents have been researching and buying in Aruba we're thinking of switching (as to be expected as we can't make a decision to save our lives!) Do you want to get married on the beach?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/tvts-las-caletas-wedding-review-pics-31890\/\">My Las Caletas Wedding Review<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/more-pro-pics-our-las-caletas-wedding-32657\/\">Pro Wedding Pics<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/tvts-eyespy-photography-review-pics-31889\/\">EyeSpy Photography Review<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/teaser-ttd-pics-31998\/\">TTD Pics<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tjvanthiel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.28.94.136","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1174672560,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207287.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tvt","Id":207287,"Name":"tvt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a38225e742238d70452a9d164f9528d","RawContent":"Probably yes, married on the beach. I would love to get married at Bucuti, it looks GORGEOUS! But we&#039;re inviting 100, and Bucuti can only host 50 people max. I&#039;m sure we wouldn&#039;t have more than 50 actually come, but if we do &amp;amp; we&#039;ve reserved Bucuti, we&#039;re a little screwed!!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheesy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":44251,"PostDate":1176926693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Probably yes, married on the beach. I would love to get married at Bucuti, it looks GORGEOUS! But we're inviting 100, and Bucuti can only host 50 people max. I'm sure we wouldn't have more than 50 actually come, but if we do & we've reserved Bucuti, we're a little screwed!!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheesy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married April 4, 2008 at the Riu Ocho Rios!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hln321@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1174600020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207275.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heidi","Id":207275,"Name":"Heidi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8c88827bfad0304f6dc0794eaced630","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;BEACHBRIDEMA&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;How many guest are you having? Arbua is pretty pricey, so Jamica may be more affordable for your guests?\n Sarah&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Yeah, we&#039;re finding that. My TA has an in with the Divi &amp;amp; Tam, and could get good rates for us there. But it&#039;d probably cost the same as Riu Ocho Rios, which seems SO much nicer. I wish I could just make a darn decision already!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":44275,"PostDate":1176930852,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>BEACHBRIDEMA<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">How many guest are you having? Arbua is pretty pricey, so Jamica may be more affordable for your guests?<br \/> Sarah<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Yeah, we're finding that. My TA has an in with the Divi & Tam, and could get good rates for us there. But it'd probably cost the same as Riu Ocho Rios, which seems SO much nicer. I wish I could just make a darn decision already!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married April 4, 2008 at the Riu Ocho Rios!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hln321@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1174600020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207275.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heidi","Id":207275,"Name":"Heidi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"637630c737da7959fa572c70a4e5258d","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpaddin