.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile123\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":44356,"PostDate":1176938070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>tvt<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">lets try this again. i'm awesome at pictures on myspace, but suck at them on this forum! <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/aycu14.webshots.com\/image\/14013\/2001630570706519058_rs.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>eeeewww!! OK, Jamaica is back as the top runner! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile123.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile123\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married April 4, 2008 at the Riu Ocho Rios!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hln321@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1174600020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207275.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heidi","Id":207275,"Name":"Heidi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b130824b2ed108020528164ec66d631","RawContent":"Hello,\n \n I know ive hit this thread a bit late but i wanted to say that i am getting married at the Tamarijn Aruba next september- i went there on holiday last July and i had the most amazing time!!\n \n The island is truly beautiful, peaceful and not destroyed by tourists like Jamaica is, i went there myself a few years ago, and i found it quite dirty and we didn&#039;t feel safe outside of the resort. The resort we stayed at was full of loud bolshy people and i have a friend who is a travel rep in Jamaica and she agrees that most of the resorts are like that,\n \n Anyway if you need any info or would like me to email you any photos from my holiday let me know,\n \n also the picture above is a load of rubbish the hotel has been totally redecorated and all the bathrooms have been upgraded!!\n \n PS YOU WALK OUT ONTO THE BEACH!!!!\n \n Best Wishes\n \n Em xxx","Attachments":[],"Id":57344,"PostDate":1180529125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello,<br \/> <br \/> I know ive hit this thread a bit late but i wanted to say that i am getting married at the Tamarijn Aruba next september- i went there on holiday last July and i had the most amazing time!!<br \/> <br \/> The island is truly beautiful, peaceful and not destroyed by tourists like Jamaica is, i went there myself a few years ago, and i found it quite dirty and we didn't feel safe outside of the resort. The resort we stayed at was full of loud bolshy people and i have a friend who is a travel rep in Jamaica and she agrees that most of the resorts are like that,<br \/> <br \/> Anyway if you need any info or would like me to email you any photos from my holiday let me know,<br \/> <br \/> also the picture above is a load of rubbish the hotel has been totally redecorated and all the bathrooms have been upgraded!!<br \/> <br \/> PS YOU WALK OUT ONTO THE BEACH!!!!<br \/> <br \/> Best Wishes<br \/> <br \/> Em xxx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>hugs x<\/span><br><br><span>em xx<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ereece015@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1171246287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207154.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pinkemi25","Id":207154,"Name":"pinkemi25","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea82767ef6a57194de790a2198b3056d","RawContent":"Hello!!\n \n hope everyone is well, i haven&#039;t been on for ages as been so busy at work and stuff, but i have booked ny wedding we are still to have an actual date confirmed but it looks to be 19th September 2008 We are going to be married at the Tamarijn in Aruba!\n \n If there is anyone else getting married in Aruba it would be great to get in contact as we may be able to help each other along the way!!\n \n I am so excited an am ready to throw myself into wedding organising now!!\n \n Good to catch up with everyone\n \n Em xx","Attachments":[],"Id":108107,"PostDate":1189563621,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello!!<br \/> <br \/> hope everyone is well, i haven't been on for ages as been so busy at work and stuff, but i have booked ny wedding we are still to have an actual date confirmed but it looks to be 19th September 2008 We are going to be married at the Tamarijn in Aruba!<br \/> <br \/> If there is anyone else getting married in Aruba it would be great to get in contact as we may be able to help each other along the way!!<br \/> <br \/> I am so excited an am ready to throw myself into wedding organising now!!<br \/> <br \/> Good to catch up with everyone<br \/> <br \/> Em xx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>hugs x<\/span><br><br><span>em xx<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ereece015@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1171246287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207154.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pinkemi25","Id":207154,"Name":"pinkemi25","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"2811","Title":"*The official Aruba Brides CHAT thread*","LastPostDate":1471272613},"Pages":{"TotalItems":432,"TotalPages":44,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":430},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
