{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7fa141faf84a682f31af82ef9acef844","RawContent":"We looked into the Divi, but ended up deciding on Jamaica instead. The Divi &amp;amp; Tam look like great resorts though!!","Attachments":[],"Id":108438,"PostDate":1189633431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We looked into the Divi, but ended up deciding on Jamaica instead. The Divi & Tam look like great resorts though!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married April 4, 2008 at the Riu Ocho Rios!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hln321@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1174600020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207275.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heidi","Id":207275,"Name":"Heidi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a500ddb5d422c5f28c46a3d53d37e98a","RawContent":"Hi... I am getting married in Aruba at the Bucuti Resort on July 24, 2008. I can&#039;t wait!!! \n \n I was a little dificult deciding on a site since everything in Aruba is so beautiful, but I am so happy we decided on the Bucuti. Nashette over there has been so helpful.\n \n What are your plans for your Aruba wedding? \n \n I am still trying to decide on types of flowers and to have either a DJ or Caribbean band and I am still up in the air about where we are going to have our welcome dinner. Hopefully we can help each other out.","Attachments":[],"Id":116797,"PostDate":1190999813,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi... I am getting married in Aruba at the Bucuti Resort on July 24, 2008. I can't wait!!! <br \/> <br \/> I was a little dificult deciding on a site since everything in Aruba is so beautiful, but I am so happy we decided on the Bucuti. Nashette over there has been so helpful.<br \/> <br \/> What are your plans for your Aruba wedding? <br \/> <br \/> I am still trying to decide on types of flowers and to have either a DJ or Caribbean band and I am still up in the air about where we are going to have our welcome dinner. Hopefully we can help each other out.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/eJ58m5\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/eJ58m5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kmullin113@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1190925062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207797.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristin113","Id":207797,"Name":"Kristin113","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23a67a991326319581632489a9e7c886","RawContent":"Helllooooo!!\n \n oh my God, i&#039;ve been waiting for so long to find someone thats getting married in Aruba as well!!\n \n The Bucuti looks lovely, we can&#039;t book that hotel as part of a package from the UK as we haven&#039;t been able to go to Aruba from the UK for very long. We went to Aruba last July and it was amazing!!\n \n We have been dealing with Lorraine from Aruba Weddings based at the Tamarijn, shes been ok but we don&#039;t sem to be getting where we want to as far as a reception is concerned!!\n \n it would be really good to stay in contact with someone who is going through the same thing as me, and hopefully we can help each other!! I&#039;ll PM you my email address\n \n E x","Attachments":[],"Id":117471,"PostDate":1191120129,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Helllooooo!!<br \/> <br \/> oh my God, i've been waiting for so long to find someone thats getting married in Aruba as well!!<br \/> <br \/> The Bucuti looks lovely, we can't book that hotel as part of a package from the UK as we haven't been able to go to Aruba from the UK for very long. We went to Aruba last July and it was amazing!!<br \/> <br \/> We have been dealing with Lorraine from Aruba Weddings based at the Tamarijn, shes been ok but we don't sem to be getting where we want to as far as a reception is concerned!!<br \/> <br \/> it would be really good to stay in contact with someone who is going through the same thing as me, and hopefully we can help each other!! I'll PM you my email address<br \/> <br \/> E x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>hugs x<\/span><br><br><span>em xx<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ereece015@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1171246287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207154.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pinkemi25","Id":207154,"Name":"pinkemi25","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d1668c3f14ce3685b75dc0133aaae3d","RawContent":"hi i am new to the board, my name is Pauline and i am gettting married in aruba at the renaissance resort and casino 5-31-08.....they have a private island that the wedding will be on........so so excited.......yet very nervous that i am not there for all the details and planning.......any and all info would be greatly greatly appreciated!!!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":120323,"PostDate":1191554201,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hi i am new to the board, my name is Pauline and i am gettting married in aruba at the renaissance resort and casino 5-31-08.....they have a private island that the wedding will be on........so so excited.......yet very nervous that i am not there for all the details and planning.......any and all info would be greatly greatly appreciated!!!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pjfit107@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1190948972,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207798.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"paulinaj","Id":207798,"Name":"paulinaj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2272b4d91750a93e813782cef765b7f8","RawContent":"Hi Pauline...\n \n I was planning on getting married at the Renaissance, but ended up going with the Bucuti. How have things been going with the Ren? What details are you still trying to work out and what type of info are you looking for? Hope I can help :o)","Attachments":[],"Id":120494,"PostDate":1191603423,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Pauline...<br \/> <br \/> I was planning on getting married at the Renaissance, but ended up going with the Bucuti. How have things been going with the Ren? What details are you still trying to work out and what type of info are you looking for? Hope I can help <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/eJ58m5\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/eJ58m5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kmullin113@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1190925062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207797.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristin113","Id":207797,"Name":"Kristin113","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a014aab6bfc344864d3ea4bed88f33db","RawContent":"hi just entertainment......are you using a band or dj?? how many people are you having?? i am having a violinist play for the ceremony but not sure yet for the reception......heard the equator band are great....renaissance suggested party posse but they sent me a sample cd and did not liike at all!!! the music is so so important and want a good mix......any suggestions&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;?? have a great day","Attachments":[],"Id":121088,"PostDate":1191689123,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hi just entertainment......are you using a band or dj?? how many people are you having?? i am having a violinist play for the ceremony but not sure yet for the reception......heard the equator band are great....renaissance suggested party posse but they sent me a sample cd and did not liike at all!!! the music is so so important and want a good mix......any suggestions<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>?? have a great day\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pjfit107@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1190948972,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207798.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"paulinaj","Id":207798,"Name":"paulinaj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e23972653d8783f652ba9f1bfb2c35cd","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;paulinaj&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;hi just entertainment......are you using a band or dj?? how many people are you having?? i am having a violinist play for the ceremony but not sure yet for the reception......heard the equator band are great....renaissance suggested party posse but they sent me a sample cd and did not liike at all!!! the music is so so important and want a good mix......any suggestions&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;?? have a great day&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I am having bout 40-50 people at my wedding and originally I was thinking of having a band, but reciently I decided to go with a DJ. I wasn&#039;t crazy about how the bands sounded either and I figured you can&#039;t really go wrong with a DJ especially if I give them a list of songs to play. Here is a link so you can hear samples of the Equator Band: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.equatorband.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.equatorband.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":121507,"PostDate":1191812216,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>paulinaj<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">hi just entertainment......are you using a band or dj?? how many people are you having?? i am having a violinist play for the ceremony but not sure yet for the reception......heard the equator band are great....renaissance suggested party posse but they sent me a sample cd and did not liike at all!!! the music is so so important and want a good mix......any suggestions<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>?? have a great day<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I am having bout 40-50 people at my wedding and originally I was thinking of having a band, but reciently I decided to go with a DJ. I wasn't crazy about how the bands sounded either and I figured you can't really go wrong with a DJ especially if I give them a list of songs to play. Here is a link so you can hear samples of the Equator Band: <a href='http:\/\/www.equatorband.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.equatorband.com\/<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/eJ58m5\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/eJ58m5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kmullin113@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1190925062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207797.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristin113","Id":207797,"Name":"Kristin113","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa6335c49f74bfdbc7e7ead86652627d","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;paulinaj&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;hi i am new to the board, my name is Pauline and i am gettting married in aruba at the renaissance resort and casino 5-31-08.....they have a private island that the wedding will be on........so so excited.......yet very nervous that i am not there for all the details and planning.......any and all info would be greatly greatly appreciated!!!!!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hello!!\n \n Welcome to our little Aruba gang, theres not many of us so we can stick together!!!\n \n I&#039;m getting mrried at the Tamarijn on 19th September 2008\n \n Em xx","Attachments":[],"Id":121877,"PostDate":1191885648,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>paulinaj<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">hi i am new to the board, my name is Pauline and i am gettting married in aruba at the renaissance resort and casino 5-31-08.....they have a private island that the wedding will be on........so so excited.......yet very nervous that i am not there for all the details and planning.......any and all info would be greatly greatly appreciated!!!!!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hello!!<br \/> <br \/> Welcome to our little Aruba gang, theres not many of us so we can stick together!!!<br \/> <br \/> I'm getting mrried at the Tamarijn on 19th September 2008<br \/> <br \/> Em xx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>hugs x<\/span><br><br><span>em xx<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ereece015@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1171246287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207154.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pinkemi25","Id":207154,"Name":"pinkemi25","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"38e7c849350e80228b3e5ccbe1dc4c24","RawContent":"hi, sorry have not had a chance to log on....yeah, i went on the equator band website, but want to hear more of what they play. what dj are you using?? what are you doing for music during your ceremony? who are you using for photographer\/videographer.....when is your wedding?? talk soon..Paulina","Attachments":[],"Id":123160,"PostDate":1192083051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hi, sorry have not had a chance to log on....yeah, i went on the equator band website, but want to hear more of what they play. what dj are you using?? what are you doing for music during your ceremony? who are you using for photographer\/videographer.....when is your wedding?? talk soon..Paulina\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pjfit107@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1190948972,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207798.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"paulinaj","Id":207798,"Name":"paulinaj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2811,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"439f7ca9033a7e24c8164fb641a7b484","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;paulinaj&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;hi, sorry have not had a chance to log on....yeah, i went on the equator band website, but want to hear more of what they play. what dj are you using?? what are you doing for music during your ceremony? who are you using for photographer\/videographer.....when is your wedding?? talk soon..Paulina&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hey Paulina...\n \n We are getting married on July 24, 2008 and I haven&#039;t decided on a DJ yet, I am waiting to see if my WC can get me samples from different people, along with samples of bands too, just to hear the difference. I will let you know if she gets me any. For the ceremony we are going to have a steel pan player. \n \n For photography we are using Paul VanDriel as our main photographer (who will be w\/ me and the girls getting ready)and then we are also going to hire another photographer to shoot the guys getting ready and the guests as they arrive. I really want to have nice Lenox picture frames as favors so we can take great sunset pictures of each couple\/family as they arrive and then I am going to send everyone their pictures once we get back home.\n \n For the video we have booked George Jacobs, but now I am rethinking the whole wedding video thing. We were originally doing it b\/c we planned to have a huge reception back home where we were going to do a wedding re-cap, but now we are just having everyone come to Aruba, so I don&#039;t know if we are still going to do the video. I think I might also get annoyed w\/ someone following me around all day videotaping me LOL.","Attachments":[],"Id":123308,"PostDate":1192122876,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>paulinaj<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">hi, sorry have not had a chance to log on....yeah, i went on the equator band website, but want to hear more of what they play. what dj are you using?? what are you doing for music during your ceremony? who are you using for photographer\/videographer.....when is your wedding?? talk soon..Paulina<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hey Paulina...<br \/> <br \/> We are getting married on July 24, 2008 and I haven't decided on a DJ yet, I am waiting to see if my WC can get me samples from different people, along with samples of bands too, just to hear the difference. I will let you know if she gets me any. For the ceremony we are going to have a steel pan player. <br \/> <br \/> For photography we are using Paul VanDriel as our main photographer (who will be w\/ me and the girls getting ready)and then we are also going to hire another photographer to shoot the guys getting ready and the guests as they arrive. I really want to have nice Lenox picture frames as favors so we can take great sunset pictures of each couple\/family as they arrive and then I am going to send everyone their pictures once we get back home.<br \/> <br \/> For the video we have booked George Jacobs, but now I am rethinking the whole wedding video thing. We were originally doing it b\/c we planned to have a huge reception back home where we were going to do a wedding re-cap, but now we are just having everyone come to Aruba, so I don't know if we are still going to do the video. I think I might also get annoyed w\/ someone following me around all day videotaping me LOL.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/eJ58m5\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/eJ58m5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kmullin113@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1190925062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207797.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristin113","Id":207797,"Name":"Kristin113","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":432,"TotalPages":44,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":430},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
